.title  Diamond-Square: a landscape out of random numbers
.what   A game ships a recipe, not a world. One multiply and one add make a random number; four adds and two shifts turn four of them into a 64x64 island, on a torus, in integers - watched one step at a time, then minted fresh on every keypress
.tier   LESSON
.main   TERRAIN.ASM
.build  FASM TERRAIN.ASM TERRAIN.COM
.run    TERRAIN.COM
.uses   MUL DIV SHL SHR AND OR LODSB OUT INT
.reads  INFOGR.PAS
.ignore MAKEINFO.BAT
